{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":5,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1502819303,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDEyMDY4OTA1NjY="},"added":["enhancement"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"a4d74e57db61621db827d9bf1f35964a33414513"},"timestamp":1516722667,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1OTgzMzg0Ng==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1718#issuecomment-359833846"},"message":"This seems like it could be useful functionality to have built into datalad at some point and not fully relying on heudiconv.  I'm imagining a scenario where someone wants to publicly publish a dataset and wants to ensure the data are fully anonymized.  This might include scrubbing names and scrambling dates.  They might not have used heudiconv at the outset and also not realize that the data creation dates might be tied to identifying subject information.\n\nScrewing around with file creation dates seems dangerous.  Could there just be a reset creation date option?  This would allow a user to pick a date to reset all file creation and/or scrub the git history.  Sort of like starting a new repository with no knowledge of the original history of the data.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1517495438,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM2MjI4MjU0Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1718#issuecomment-362282547"},"message":"The strategy should probably be\n- for initial commit - take some date in the past\n- take the latest date from\n  - the last commit within the branch and git-annex branch in the dataset\n  - the same for each subdataset to be committed\n- increment by some amount of past time (1 second)\n\nAnd it should be implemented at the level of `commit` operation based on some envvar flag to trigger it (since would be difficult if not impossible to channel that flag for all commands which `commit/save`)","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1528799506,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM5NjU0MzYyNA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1718#issuecomment-396543624"},"message":"I think this is done now. Reopen, if I am wrong.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1528799506,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTY3NTk0MDc4MQ=="},"status":2}]}